{"3484850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scam Center Simulator: UnderKingdom", "steam_appid": 3484850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/400a695abe629383b7c1f9f352fccdea.avif?t=1786977721\" width=461 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/18455dce0a7905a16d5ae02ab1308637.poster.avif?t=1786977721\" width=864 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/18455dce0a7905a16d5ae02ab1308637.webm?t=1786977721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/18455dce0a7905a16d5ae02ab1308637.mp4?t=1786977721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scam Centre Simulator: Under Kingdom</strong> is a darkly humorous management simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burdened with massive debt, you are invited to a mysterious town to build your own underground scam empire. Manage your scam compound, abduct tourists for labor, gather essential resources like electricity and food, and trade with the mayor, police, and locals. Will you rise to rule the Under Kingdom, or be consumed by chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a89abded5cb6aaaf3446eb85dd071d87.avif?t=1786977721\" width=461 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/59e6268019a05ed2b3ef424fdab10213.poster.avif?t=1786977721\" width=864 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/59e6268019a05ed2b3ef424fdab10213.webm?t=1786977721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/59e6268019a05ed2b3ef424fdab10213.mp4?t=1786977721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use a variety of scam tactics to generate profit</strong>, from theft, phishing emails, and manipulating dating apps, to running online casinos and even cheating at the gambling table. Upgrade your equipment and turn every deception into flowing profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/39707c5eb6de6ddb7aadd2b08f9ebe63.avif?t=1786977721\" width=461 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/27364a75bc15ecdc6936a3e7a78c37ac.poster.avif?t=1786977721\" width=864 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/27364a75bc15ecdc6936a3e7a78c37ac.webm?t=1786977721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/27364a75bc15ecdc6936a3e7a78c37ac.mp4?t=1786977721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for individuals with different specialties</strong>, cleaners, porters, dealers, and bring them under your control through force. Assign roles strategically, maximize their abilities, and build a highly efficient underground operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/ee70f0a7d47de72e3505babe90e17776.avif?t=1786977721\" width=610 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/5322616980f26e2194fdc9b9de293b3a.poster.avif?t=1786977721\" width=864 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/5322616980f26e2194fdc9b9de293b3a.webm?t=1786977721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/5322616980f26e2194fdc9b9de293b3a.mp4?t=1786977721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your scam center and maintain order within the compound. Monitor your workers’ physical and mental condition, and maintain control through punishment or “re-education.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/e80ca6587c3653c513bb7f9c98d023c6.avif?t=1786977721\" width=698 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/58a5d1e6601376f920963ca1ec1a8b1c.poster.avif?t=1786977721\" width=864 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as